    # "It was starting to become almost routine--though each visit was somehow just as exciting as the last~"
    nvl clear
    "Stava iniziando quasi a diventare routine--anche se in qualche modo ogni visita era tanto emozionante quanto la precedente~"

# game/script.rpy:1178
